            "data": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"markdown-body\"\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eAccessing MapR-DB in Zeppelin Using the MapR-DB OJAI Connector with Python\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis section contains examples of Apache Spark Python jobs that use the MapR-DB OJAI Connector for Apache Spark to read and write MapR-DB JSON tables.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e"
